# W3C OWL 2 Conformance Test Fixture
# Source: OWL 2 Structural Specification S8.3 - Property Characteristics
# Reference: https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-syntax/#Object_Property_Axioms

@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:testOntology a owl:Ontology .

ex:hasMother a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
ex:hasSSN a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:InverseFunctionalProperty .
ex:ancestorOf a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:TransitiveProperty .
ex:marriedTo a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:SymmetricProperty .
ex:isChildOf a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:AsymmetricProperty , owl:IrreflexiveProperty .
ex:knows a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:ReflexiveProperty .
